    "summary": "The router routes session-class requests through the session pool: shared-state methods to the shared-state worker, others to the session's worker or the unattributed worker; a per-session FIFO sends each request only after the previous one ended (FIFO-exempt methods and unattributed requests are not queued); connection-scoped requests stay on the main thread.",
